  "chapter_readings": [
    {
      "text": "Tom holds the compass. The children say together: “Reparo!” A golden spark flashes. The compass is whole again! The compass needle spins and points to a green door. “It works!” shouts Tom. Radiophone says: “Behind the door, someone is waiting for your help.”",
